    "<div style=\"background-color:#0b0905;border:1px solid #2b2410;border-top:2px solid #d4af37;border-radius:6px;padding:14px 22px 12px;margin:26px 0 8px;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0;padding:0;border:0;font-family:Fraunces,Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:23px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:700;color:#f3d77a;\">1.1. Data Location &amp; Global Settings</h2><div style=\"font-family:Manrope,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.5;color:#a8a086;font-style:italic;margin-top:5px;\">Finds the two Excel files automatically using their names and fixes the random seed.</div></div>"
